OL,3,AChildminder who left 27 children alone
OL,4,Ain her home pleads guilty to neglect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dunfermline childminder has admitted
OL,7,Fleaving more than 20 children she was
OL,8,Fcaring for alone and unsupervised in
OL,9,Fher home.
OL,11,FAmanda Mathewson, 55, pleaded guilty at
OL,12,FKirkcaldy Sheriff Court to neglect and
OL,13,Fabandoning children in her care.
OL,15,FHer offending took place at a number of
OL,16,Flocations in Dunfermline and elsewhere
OL,17,Fin Fife.
OL,19,FThe court heard Mathewson had 27
OL,20,Fchildren in her home, 19 more than she
OL,21,Fwas licensed to look after.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
